-- Chest Collector 1-54 (VantixUI style)
-- Collects numbered chests ("1" .. "54") like the models in your place file.
-- Handles both kinds: chests that never come back AND chests that respawn.
-- A respawn is detected when a chest becomes available again, then re-collected.
-- Opened through the OpenChest remote, found via each chest's ProximityPrompt.
-- Instant: zeroes each prompt's HoldDuration, no T-hold needed.
-- Streaming: remembers positions and walks back to chests whose area isn't rendered.
-- Works in a real executor (loads the real VantixUI) and in this editor
-- (falls back to a built-in shim that mirrors the same calls).
-- Strict Luau subset (no +=, no continue): runs on stock Lua 5.3 too.

local OPEN_REMOTE_NAME = "OpenChest"

